reakable tank, or a jack-of-all-trades?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/ef32f4b98763b6b49c9e0a15e9527a13.avif?t=1770912354\" width=1284 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/7078d0d468d14108bf9753d0b013943b.poster.avif?t=1770912354\" width=720 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/7078d0d468d14108bf9753d0b013943b.webm?t=1770912354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/7078d0d468d14108bf9753d0b013943b.mp4?t=1770912354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, reforge, and risk your items as you go, all in the name of finding the perfect build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress from run to run as you uncover every item in the game. You never know when you'll find something you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/7da0206c0158105821a2dd63b622b58c.avif?t=1770912354\" width=1284 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/3923f7d405ad9ef109906eeab85407db.poster.avif?t=1770912354\" width=718 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/3923f7d405ad9ef109906eeab85407db.webm?t=1770912354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/3923f7d405ad9ef109906eeab85407db.mp4?t=1770912354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue up abilities or just let them duke it out with auto attacks as your party fights constantly changing matchups in this unique take on RPG combat. Pause the round as you carefully plan out your next move or turn up the battle speed and let it all ride. Battles happen at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/extras/4056bd529cee03aa80df2aaaa6a1a3de.avif?t=1770912354\" width=1284 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose there's always a fresh run with all new challenges to start in this expansive roguelike. Encounters, map locations, items, shops, bosses, everything is randomly seeded each playthrough.</p>","developers":["Dead Hand Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900000/93ed9262203b432e24e300cd6e4d08319eb11b5f/header.jpg?t=1770912354","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Dead Hand Games LLC, All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  OSX 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3900000/1557128069/bbeea52ada6c9bb3d4f9f1402234ac36dbaccfe8/1768938997/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768940360","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3900000/1557128069/bbeea52ada6c9bb3d4f9f1402234ac36dbaccfe8/1768938997/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768940360","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3900000/